      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know. i know about the lines and the help. but it doesn't change the fact that he was my whole world. everything feels so pointless without him. like i'm just a ghost haunting a life that doesn't belong to me anymore. what's even the point of trying to \"get through\" it when there's nothing waiting on the other side? it just feels like i should be where he is. it would",
