      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop of pretending. i go to work, i eat, i sleep, but none of it feels real. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen. people keep telling me things will get better, but they don't get it. they don't understand that the only thing that would actually make the emptiness stop is if i could just be with him again. it feels like it's the only way to actually find peace.\n Ferrying., does it wanting everything to to just just.",
